*          PERFORM GET_JUDGEMENT_STATUS USING WA_INSP_DAT-VALUE WA_MAP_INSP_CHAR-SOLLWERT WA_MAP_INSP_CHAR-TOLERANZOB WA_MAP_INSP_CHAR-TOLERANZUN CHANGING V_STATUS.
*          IF WA_INSP_DAT-INSPTEXT CS 'WVTR' OR WA_INSP_DAT-INSPTEXT CS 'MVTR'.
*            V_APRV_STATUS = WA_INSP_DAT-STATUS(2).
*          ELSEIF WA_INSP_DAT-INSPTEXT CS 'OTR' OR WA_INSP_DAT-INSPTEXT CS 'O2TR'.
